THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
    Some papers in papers/ are authored by collaborators outside Silicon
    Scaffolding and remain the copyright of their respective authors. Where a
    document names an author other than those above, that document's own terms
    govern. Cryptobiosis and Nearest Clean Water are Emmett Dunning's work.

    Quoted material, model outputs from other vendors, and screenshots of
    third-party systems are included under fair use for scholarship and
    criticism and are not relicensed here.

